<v Rennie Sparks>I go into Anthony's and buy three slices with pepperoni with the last of my money. I eat as fast as I can, with warm grease dripping down my neck. My throat burns with swallowing so fast.
<v Rennie Sparks>我走进安东尼披萨店，用身上剩下的钱买了三片意大利辣香肠披萨。我拼命地吃，温热的油脂顺着脖子流下。喉咙因为吞咽太快而灼烧。

00:47:47.030 --> 00:48:04.560
<v Rennie Sparks>Inside the Sears bathroom there are two girls at the sink. I don't know them. One girl has her head back, and the other is French braiding her hair. Best friends. When they see me, one of them reaches up, turns on the hand dryer to shut me out.
<v Rennie Sparks>西尔斯百货的洗手间里，有两个女孩在洗手池旁。我不认识她们。一个女孩仰着头，另一个在帮她编法式辫。最好的朋友。当她们看到我时，其中一人伸手打开了干手机，要把我隔绝在外。

00:48:04.560 --> 00:48:23.520
<v Rennie Sparks>I go into a stall and lean over the bowl, one hand holding onto the toilet paper roll. The other hand turns into a knife. I stick it down into my throat until my stomach starts to shake and my mouth gags open, and the pizza rushes back up me and down, splashing into the bowl.
<v Rennie Sparks>我走进隔间，俯身对着马桶，一只手抓着卫生纸卷。另一只手变成了一把刀。我把它伸进喉咙里，直到胃部开始颤抖，嘴巴干呕张开，披萨涌了上来，又吐了出来，溅进马桶里。

00:48:23.520 --> 00:48:34.960
<v Rennie Sparks>The hand dryer clicks off. One of the girls says, "Lisa should never wear yellow. Have you noticed that? She looks like a frog in yellow. It's weird."
<v Rennie Sparks>干手机停了。其中一个女孩说：“丽莎真不该穿黄色的。你发现了吗？她穿黄色就像只青蛙。真奇怪。”

00:48:34.960 --> 00:49:11.170
<v Rennie Sparks>I lean against the wall of the stall, my head against the coat hook. My stomach feels thin and flat, empty. I let out a deep breath of air, and just for that one moment, between letting air out and filling myself up again, I feel beautiful, like a puzzle piece sliding in to fit. But then it's gone, and I flush the toilet and come out.
<v Rennie Sparks>我靠在隔间的墙上，头顶着挂衣钩。胃里感觉又平又扁，空空如也。我长长地舒了一口气，就在那一刻，在呼气和再次吸气之间的空档，我感到自己很美，就像一块拼图滑入槽位刚好契合。但瞬间那感觉就消失了，我冲掉马桶，走了出去。

00:49:11.170 --> 00:49:23.310
